        "TileImage": "$($repository 8943b399-8e00-4a7b-ae79-41863722c45a).Image",
        "Description": "Aron Ford Jr. and his hired gun Ben Moore have been causing nothing but trouble, stirring up controversy after controversy. Ridding the world of them would make it a better place.  You can&apos;t change your starting disguise at all, so be careful! Tie up all loose ends, and high tail it out of there!\r\rAny day that we can rid the world of a lawyer is a good one, 47.\r\r-Rijo",
